    "checklist.menu.copyCheckedItems.noCheckedItems" : {
      "comment" : "Appears inside the overflow menu, directly under the Copy Checked Items to… entry, when that entry is tapped with nothing ticked, and fades again after a moment. Not a button — it says why nothing happened. Echo the wording of checklist.menu.copyCheckedItems: it should read as \"there are none of the thing that entry copies\", so reuse that key's word for checked items rather than picking a synonym. Keep it to a few words.",
